Z||000001||Kage86GT4SP||11-26-1999||10:34 PM||||I HAD them in my 86 TA 383.  The boots litterally turned into the consistency of silly puddy.  I dumped them for a $20 set of accel u-cuts.<P>I wasted 60$ on the MSD's.  Such is life.||||reg||1
