Z||000016||fierosound||12-01-1999||04:52 PM||||Bill<P>This is all I've got on the packaging.<P>HOLLEY Annihilator Coil - #820-214 - Lasershot Street Inductive<P>TAYLOR Vertex Pro Series - #074224 Spiro-Pro Custom 6-cyl red<P>I got them at a local Speed Shop.  Please keep in mind, most Auto Performance websites don't bother to list all items in their online catalogs, just the most common (ie: Camaro, Mustang, V8s etc.)  Many times the shops don't realize they have ANYTHING for a Fiero until they take the time to check the manufacturer's catalog. You almost have to instruct them as to what's avaiable!!<P>If you phone Summit, I'm sure they can price them for you.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 12-01-1999).]||||reg||10
